    "**This week**\n\n- The checkout page loads in under a second.\n- Two color options for the home page are drafted.\n- The weekly report now writes itself every Friday.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**本周**\n\n- 结账页一秒内打开。\n- 首页的两套配色已起草。\n- 周报现在每周五自动写好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ", ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A connection wants to reach this site": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有连接要去这个网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sign-in now lasts 30 minutes (`auth/session.ts`), and all 48 tests pass. Pushing needs your permission.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录有效期改成了 30 分钟（`auth/session.ts`），48 个测试全部通过。推送要你授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
