    "Yew Harness notifies this iPhone when something needs you (a permission, a question, a decision or a held letter), when a session stops with an error, and when a task finishes. What a notification says is encrypted for this iPhone; the relay and Apple cannot read it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有事要你处理（授权、提问、决定、待放行的信）、会话出错停下、任务做完时，Yew Harness 通知这台 iPhone。通知的内容为这台 iPhone 加密，中继和 Apple 都读不到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yew Harness on iPhone connects to your Mac through a relay, encrypted end to end. Away from your desk, you handle what needs you here: allow operations, answer the sessions' questions and decide on cards, and you can follow and reply to sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 上的 Yew Harness 经中继连接你的 Mac，两端之间端到端加密。离开电脑时，你在这里处理要你做的事：授权操作、回答会话的提问、处理决定卡，也能看会话的进展并回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
